### Milestone Design Rationale — Addressing All Critiques

| Task | Old Rule (Broken) | New Rule (Fixed) | Why |
|------|-------------------|------------------|-----|
| eat cooked_rabbit | inventory_has cooked_rabbit ≥1 (rewards pickup, not eating) | has_effect: saturation | Eating food grants saturation effect; confirms consumption |
| use splash potion of swiftness | inventory_has splash_potion ≥1 (rewards pickup; using REMOVES item) | has_effect: speed | Splash potion of swiftness grants Speed effect; confirms use |
| interact with blast furnace | position_near_with_facing (proximity ≠ interaction) | inventory_has iron_ingot ≥1 | No iron ingots exist in scene (only raw_iron); having iron_ingot PROVES blast furnace was used to smelt |
| repair Iron Helmet | inventory_has iron_helmet ≥1 (can't distinguish damaged vs repaired) | inventory_has_with_durability max_damage:50 | Original helmet has Damage:100; repaired must be below 50 damage |
| find lake | max_distance=10 (nearly auto-completable) | max_distance=5 | Forces player to actually walk to lake edge |

### Key Design Decisions

